WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Saturday afternoon.

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.490
You're walking down a busy high
street, minding your own business.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.900
A stranger in a guard's
uniform steps into your path,

4
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.440
points down and says:
pick up that paper bag.

5
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:13.900
It isn't your bag.

6
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.420
He isn't your teacher or your boss.

7
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.260
So why is it so hard to say no?

8
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.530
In this mission, you'll find out
what psychologists mean by obedience,

9
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.640
and what makes people obey.

10
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.710
You'll find out whether what someone
wears changes how we respond,

11
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.190
and whether distance makes a difference.

12
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:37.150
And you'll find out whether some kinds
of personality obey more than others.

13
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:42.370
Your mission: explain why a stranger
in uniform is so hard to refuse.
